WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.528
Open Settings, then RosterEase Plus, to
check your access and see the plans.

00:00:06.728 --> 00:00:08.633
Shifts is free for one workplace.

00:00:09.483 --> 00:00:11.639
Visits is free for five active clients.

00:00:12.539 --> 00:00:16.048
Notes, manual check-ins, widgets and
backups don't need a subscription.

00:00:17.298 --> 00:00:19.876
Finishing your first setup starts a free
week of full Plus.

00:00:20.776 --> 00:00:22.917
That week doesn't charge you or renew by
itself.

00:00:24.117 --> 00:00:27.244
A subscription is a separate choice, and it
renews until you cancel.

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:30.664
Use See Plus Plans to compare what's
included.

00:00:31.514 --> 00:00:33.511
Check the App Store price before
subscribing.

00:00:34.411 --> 00:00:36.788
Restore purchases is for a subscription you
already have.

00:00:37.988 --> 00:00:39.773
You don't need to buy anything to close
this screen.

00:00:40.623 --> 00:00:42.889
If Plus ends, the things you've saved stay.
